      "start": 1500,
      "details": "<p class=\"p1\"><em>Serm\u012bn</em>:\u00a0It is a small town belonging to the the districts of Aleppo. In former times it had around three hundred mosques, and prayers were performed in all of them.\u00a0At present, only one mosque remains in which the prayers are performed.\u00a0Most of its people were <em>\u0130sma\u2018\u012bliyye</em> (Ism\u0101\u2018\u012bl\u012bs).\u00a0After some time, when the Tatar army took control, their order and community were disrupted. [translation]</p>",
